<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to inject 3.611 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to inject 3.611 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico sought to inject 3.611 billion pesos in the secondary market on Friday through three credit auctions, and had already placed one credit at 27.25 percent, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM	AVERAGE</p>
<p>    1.305 bln  14 days    27.25 pct</p>
<p>    1.306 bln  12 days</p>
<p>    1.000 bln   1 day</p>
<p>- Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559</p>
</text>
